            <ArticleTitle>Muscle relaxants and antispasticity agents.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>401-13</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Muscle relaxants make up a heterogeneous group of agents and can have a clinically significant role in the treatment of chronic muscle pain. These medications are not without possible serious side effects; hence, care should be taken in deciding on their appropriateness and ongoing monitoring performed, if prescribed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
